================================================================================
Ported sources: mac4DSTEM and macTEM
================================================================================

The cell, lattice and reflection-list code, the CIF parser with its
written-precision expansion and its refusals, the family (ring) rule and the
monoclinic orbit convention are ported from mac4DSTEM (commit 7448401b:
mac4DSTEM/Core/Crystal/Crystal.swift, CrystalModel.swift, CIFImport.swift) and
macTEM before v1.0.0 (history squashed: Sources/TEMCore/Analysis/DSpacingIndexing.swift,
and its design notes), generalised to the seven crystal systems.
The CIF fixtures under Tests/DiffractoCoreTests/Fixtures come from mac4DSTEM's
tests at the same commit, each with its provenance in a comment line.

Later parts were read at mac4DSTEM 7d6fdbd1 (structure factors and the |F|
cut, Crystal.swift and ScatteringFactors.swift; EllipseCalibration.swift with
ADR 069; the ellipse transform of Calibration.swift; the zone axes of
PhaseReferenceLibrary.swift, OrientationPlan.swift and OrientationResult.swift)
and macTEM before v1.0.0 (history squashed: RingCalibration.swift,
RingCalibration+Fit.swift and DSpacingIndexing.swift). The ring-fit tests port
those applications' plants and their renderer at those versions. macTEM's public
history starts at v1.0.0, so its earlier commits are named by version, not hash.

